Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

templatize renames the placeholder chart name "tzscaffold" to the chart's name
and has modified these files:

- templates/deployment.yaml: optional .Values.containerName, .Values.containerPort,
  .Values.command, .Values.args, .Values.env and .Values.envFrom; serviceAccountName
  is only set when a service account is created or named.
- templates/service.yaml: optional .Values.service.targetPort (default "http").

values.yaml is the unmodified default; templatize writes its own, starting from it.
